section_text:
VII. EXPECTED PROJECT RESULTS AND JUSTIFICATION  
7.1 The project is expected to achieve  the following results including:  
a. Expansion of the concept of ecoefficiency among enterprises as an important factor of competitiveness and profitability;  
b. Improvements in the quality of the workforce through the training of workers and employees;  
c. Promotion of improvements achieved in comp anies in both technical and technological 
areas;  
d. Improvements in the relationship of companies with environmental authorities, clients and 
communities; 
e. Strengthening of the relationship with financia l institutions in order to facilitate access to 
credit for SMEs interested in CP; 
f. Improvement in the environmental quality in ur ban areas to minimize health related risks to 
Mexicans; and 
g. Creation of self-sustainable centers to provide CP services on a permanent basis.
